+  // Local patch (S16): the pinned code handed Msg4's SDUs (RRCSetup) to RLC
+  // before contention resolution was checked, so a UE that lost contention
+  // still processed the winner's RRCSetup. Read the Contention Resolution CE
+  // first and pass the SDUs up only when it matches this UE.
+  rx_pdu_tcrnti.init_rx();
